/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Plantsia is an innovative software project designed as an e-commerce platform specialized in selling plants and agricultural supplies. It was developed using modern technologies including Flutter for the frontend, Node.js for the backend, and MongoDB as the database. The system serves three main user roles: Admin, Shop Owner, and User, each with distinct responsibilities that ensure smooth operation and management of the platform.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Admin oversees the platform by managing user roles \(adding, editing, or deleting\), viewing sales analytics, and adding new shop owners to expand the online marketplace. Shop Owners manage their shops by adding and updating plant and supply listings, receiving and processing orders, and handling modifications and deletions as needed. Users can browse and order plants and supplies, manage their favorite plants list, and use AI-based image analysis to diagnose plant diseases, understand causes, and receive treatment suggestions. Additionally, the platform provides a powerful search function for enhanced user convenience.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Plantsia demonstrates how software technologies can modernize agricultural commerce, promote digital transformation in the agricultural sector, and provide intelligent solutions to meet evolving market needs while supporting sustainability and innovation in smart farming.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
