359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The initial and most critical step in the project was selecting the idea. As a team passionate about plants and their importance in our daily lives and environment, we wanted to contribute to this field by combining our love for plants with technology. While exploring different ideas, we realized the challenges in traditional plant commerce, such as inefficiency, limited accessibility, and the absence of smart solutions. This inspired us to develop Plantsia, an innovative platform aimed at enhancing the online sale of plants and agricultural supplies. Our goal was to create a system that not only simplifies management for shop owners but also offers an enjoyable, flexible, and modern shopping experience for plant lovers.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
