644 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this project, an integrated platform for plant and agricultural supply commerce was successfully designed and implemented, streamlining processes from shop management to order handling and AI-based plant disease diagnosis. The system demonstrated high efficiency in simplifying operations, enhancing the shopping experience, and supporting both shop owners and users compared to traditional plant commerce methods. Features like flexible product management, real-time sales analytics, and smart plant health detection added significant value, making the platform adaptable to a wide range of user needs.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
645 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (While most objectives were successfully achieved, such as improving efficiency and ensuring data consistency, some minor challenges were observed, including occasional variations in image analysis accuracy and performance fluctuations under high load. These challenges highlight areas for future optimization and enhancements.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
